OL,3,GNEWSAEducating teens through football
OL,4,Ais a great buzz, says Gerrard
OL,5,
OL,6,FEx-Liverpool captain Steven Gerrard has
OL,7,Fsaid seeing the progress of his academy
OL,8,Fstudents - who might otherwise have
OL,9,Fdropped out of formal education - is a
OL,10,F"great buzz".
OL,12,FThe Reds legend, recently voted the top
OL,13,Fplayer of all time in a poll carried
OL,14,Fout by the club, launched his football
OL,15,Fand education programme for 16-19 year
OL,16,Folds in 2011.
OL,18,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell visited
OL,19,Fthe site in Mossley Hill on Friday to
OL,20,Flearn more about how young people not
OL,21,Ffollowing conventional academic
OL,22,Fpathways are engaged through football.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
