OL,3,GNEWSAEducating teens through football
OL,4,Ais a great buzz, says Gerrard
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerrard said: "I was lucky, I had a
OL,7,Fcareer in the game, but if I didn't...
OL,8,FI'd have been like a lot of these kids
OL,9,Fwhere you're at a crossroads when you
OL,10,Fcome out of education."
